    {
      "title": "How It Works",
      "content": "LLM-based agents rely on specific design patterns that encapsulate a core suite of LLM abilities. Evaluating these capabilities is crucial to understanding the potential and limitations of these agents. <strong>Benchmarks and evaluation frameworks</strong> have been developed to assess these capabilities, including planning, tool use, self-reflection, and memory.",
