    {
      "title": "Application-Specific Agents",
      "content": "The landscape of application-specific agents is rapidly expanding, with specialized agents emerging across popular categories such as web, software, game, embodied, and scientific agents. <strong>Evaluation frameworks and benchmarks</strong> have been developed to assess the diverse capabilities of these agents, including task completion, navigational efficiency, and policy compliance.",
