    {
      "title": "The Results",
      "content": "The survey reveals emerging trends in agent evaluation, including a shift toward more realistic and challenging evaluations with continuously updated benchmarks. <strong>Key gaps in current research</strong> have been identified, particularly in assessing cost-efficiency, safety, and robustness, and in developing fine-grained and scalable evaluation methods.",
